      "text": "Framework diagram (Figura 1, “Esquema de aplicación del plan de acción”) with one colour-coded row for each strategic objective OE1–OE4 and five columns: Objetivos, Resultados, Productos, Políticas y medidas, and Efectos buscados, linked by arrows. The intended effects are, in order: an increasingly appropriate and sustainable digital health ecosystem; cost-effective and efficient health systems and services; accelerated digitalization of the health and well-being sector; and healthier populations.",
